,"shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","review_id":"UrxXxp9NbfcUV11_Z5H3pA","date":"2015-10-29T18:53:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9472061395645142,"text_excerpt":"I love Mizado! It is modern \"latino\" cuisine, but as a Louisianan I'm not well versed in Central and south American food. But their food is delicious. I've been twice on a Sunday around 12 PM, where we were given an option of brunch menu or the regular one. They serve some small/share plates, which is right up my alley. The next time I went was a weekday evening and we sat on the patio. I love the tableside traditional guacamole. I tried the guac \"India\" and it wasn't my thing but I'm a huge fan of avocado and don't see any need to improve on the original guacamole recipe. The salmon tiradito was the bomb, and all the salsas I tasted were distinct and yummy. TRY THE CUCUMBER JALAPENO MARG..."},{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","review_id":"wdrXter4dx6lugxmbPUpuQ","date":"2014-03-30T16:29:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9447571039199829,"text_excerpt":"Table of 6 and we all very much enjoyed everything we had. Jalapeño margaritas were fabulous. Our server had great suggestions and was very helpful and attentive. At some point during the evening it took a very long time to get refills on our alcoholic beverages but that was the bar being backed up and not our server's fault. We all just ordered a few things and shared which was a great way to experience lots of things. I will list the items we had, but please excuse the all caps, as I'm copying and pasting from the menu. We had: traditional Guac: I really enjoyed the guac. There wasn't a lot of onion and cilantro but it was just fresh and delicious. Their chip strips are good by themselv..."},{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","review_id":"_BAeE5HkTxOe39tNEKVbwg","date":"2014-04-21T19:23:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9441238641738892,"text_excerpt":"A great patio lunch with friends on a Friday with plates to go around. I had been meaning to visit Mizado, so on Good Friday I met up with two friends here. I have a personal anxiety about Valet Parking, 1. 'cause of \"Ferris Bueller's Day Off\" and 2. my cars always a wreck but it was free so I said, \"what the hell.\" The interior was modern with more of a Latino feel than Mexican with salsa-esque music playing. We chose to sit on the patio since it was a beautiful day. I love the patio though I think investing in some trees/partitions to block out the I-10 would make it 100% perfect. Seats were comfy and table was a good size, and the highway is definitely not loud enough to deter you from..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","photo_id":"sx84wFq3FIUm-P5SGoqtyg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sx84wFq3FIUm-P5SGoqtyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9293158650398254},{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","photo_id":"PtHqGiwlCzipUyZLJwhyPQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/PtHqGiwlCzipUyZLJwhyPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.899503767490387},{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","photo_id":"2Vc7cXqaQDetCG_xh2zkzw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/2Vc7cXqaQDetCG_xh2zkzw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8679189682006836},{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","photo_id":"ac92cZ7oGB36Am2NfAZ_2A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ac92cZ7oGB36Am2NfAZ_2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8431981801986694},{"business_id":"UjFLIhKTOiFcQiziOA9rgA","photo_id":"FDEmwSpxVBnukhb7W0dAMw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FDEmwSpxVBnukhb7W0dAMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8037135601043701}]},"notebook_case":null}
